cff-version: 1.2.0
title: AgentCaptureBench
message: If you use AgentCaptureBench, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Rafi Imam
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/rafiimam/agent-capture-bench
abstract: >-
  A ground-truth benchmark for process-capture tools on Linux. An eBPF oracle
  observes process execution at kernel tracepoints; recorder-under-test
  outputs are compared against that ground truth under a four-way
  classification discipline (conformant / capture failure / scope limitation /
  undetermined), with no composite scores.
keywords:
  - eBPF
  - benchmark
  - process-capture
  - observability
  - security-audit
